@startuml DiagramaDeFluxoDeDados
actor User
participant "API Gateway" as APIGW
participant "Authentication Service" as Auth
participant "User Service" as UserSvc
participant "Product Service" as ProdSvc
participant "Order Service" as OrderSvc
participant "Payment Service" as PaySvc
participant "Message Broker" as MB
participant "Cache (Redis)" as Cache
participant "Database (SQL/NoSQL)" as DB

User -> APIGW: Request
APIGW -> Auth: Authenticate
Auth -> UserSvc: Query User
UserSvc -> DB: SELECT * FROM users WHERE id = ?
DB --> UserSvc: Return User
UserSvc --> Auth: Return User
Auth --> APIGW: Return Token
APIGW --> User: Return Token

User -> APIGW: Request Product
APIGW -> ProdSvc: Get Product
ProdSvc -> Cache: Check Cache
Cache --> ProdSvc: Cache Miss
ProdSvc -> DB: SELECT * FROM products WHERE id = ?
DB --> ProdSvc: Return Product
ProdSvc --> Cache: Update Cache
ProdSvc --> APIGW: Return Product
APIGW --> User: Return Product

User -> APIGW: Place Order
APIGW -> OrderSvc: Create Order
OrderSvc -> MB: Publish Order Created Event
OrderSvc -> DB: INSERT INTO orders
DB --> OrderSvc: Return Order
OrderSvc --> APIGW: Return Order
APIGW --> User: Return Order

MB -> PaySvc: Process Payment
PaySvc -> DB: INSERT INTO payments
DB --> PaySvc: Return Payment
PaySvc -> MB: Publish Payment Processed Event
@enduml